SUMMARY:Phil Barlow Deep Treasures EP Launch Cooroy
DESCRIPTION:Phil Barlow 'Deep Treasures' EP Launch Sunday 13 September | 3p
 m | 13+ | BYO Deep Treasures is a collection of songs shaped by a slow and
  profound inner journey of healing. It is a musical passage through loss\,
  acceptance\, courage and faith. Captured raw in single-take solo-acoustic
  recordings\, these songs hold the aliveness of the emotional transformati
 on Phil was experiencing when they were written. They are not about perfec
 tion\, they are about the raw and vulnerable human journey through relatio
 nships\, trust\, change\, forgiveness and growth. In the cosy atmosphere o
 f The Nook\, Phil will perform the EP in its stripped-back solo-acoustic f
 orm and share some of the stories behind the songs.
LOCATION:Locals in the Loop
